[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the vehicle on a lift.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429404\">5540A44</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p><a href=\"#/2429742\">7210E66</a></p><p>1. Release the retaining buttons from the centre buffer using the\nspecial tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.878.077.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the buffers releasing them from the inner retainers.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045270.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the buffers are\nnot damaged.</p><p>Place the buffers in position attaching\nthe retainers.</p><p>Fit the retaining buttons.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429742\">7210E66</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429404\">5540A44</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p>"]]